---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, href, CONTACT_LINKS } from '../lib/site';

// Comparison copy is paired with Research/notes/career-narrative-revised.md.
---

<Base
  title="About"
  description="Architecture, technical strategy, engineering leadership, and Grow Youth Giving."
  ogSlug="about"
>
  <div class="page-head">
    <h1>About</h1>
    <p class="lede">{SITE.focus}.</p>
    <hr class="page-head__rule" />
  </div>

  <div class="prose">
    <p>I've worked across software engineering, product, program management, and architecture at Micron, Tableau, and Comscore. The questions I keep coming back to are how the parts of a system fit together, what we're trying to change, and which technical choices will actually help.</p>

<p>At Comscore I led enterprise architecture and technical strategy across a technology organization of 200-plus, alongside engineering management responsibilities that culminated in the SVP Engineering role. My work included setting the software development lifecycle and operating cadence, and leading a group of cross-functional architects.</p>

<p>The work I'm most interested in is architecture and technical strategy: understanding the constraints, weighing the alternatives, and setting direction that teams can use. My engineering leadership experience gives me a view of what those decisions ask of the people who have to carry them out.</p>

<p>I write about systems and engineering judgment, including what changes when AI becomes part of the work. The <a href={href('/field-guide')}>Field Guide</a> collects the reasoning I wrote down for the architects I led. <a href={href('/writing/model-output-is-not-telemetry')}>Model output is not telemetry</a> looks at the evidence we need before letting an agent's account of a system determine what happens next.</p>

<p>I also built <a href={href('/giving')}>Grow Youth Giving</a> to help families and communities introduce young people to giving. I think learning about money should include understanding nonprofits, choosing what to support, and explaining why. The site shares a simple family grant-making program and materials others can adapt. I want people to see that they can start small and make this teaching part of their own lives.</p>

<p>My role at Comscore ended in August 2026, and I'm taking some time off before my next role.</p>

    {
      CONTACT_LINKS.length > 0 && (
        <p>
          You can find me on{' '}
          {CONTACT_LINKS.map((link, i) => (
            <>
              {i > 0 && ' or '}
              <a href={link.href} rel="me noopener">{link.label}</a>
            </>
          ))}.
        </p>
      )
    }
  </div>
</Base>
